<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h2a5cf8dag50dcg4f7dg8ea8ga4f474f39a53" version="1">很好，小丑都到齐了。你们的马戏团团长到场了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h78dcb05cg0c53g41cdga717gd0f892f8bbd7" version="1">你们看起来很无聊。让我用一点混沌来解决这个问题。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2c5d9c15ga1d9g4a5agb1f1g6658e782acd3" version="1">我押了你今天会输。别让我失望。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf12715ccg0bb0g4320gbb10g0e1d4d33bd87" version="1">这将是传奇的一战！对我而言。你是大家会跳过的那一段。</content>
	<content contentuid="h463c3190g1943g4cc2g9ad4g1b5f9ef50375" version="1">哎呀。这谁能想得到呢。</content>

	<content contentuid="h12fa5306g4a59g4857g89b3g063a34c2733a" version="1">正在与混沌的魔网调和……然后，砰！</content>
	<content contentuid="hf3191a6cg3c1cg4a1fgbcd6g02fec6e61bd3" version="1">今天什么都不顺。而这不知怎么就成了你的错！</content>
	<content contentuid="h3fb69a5agfc6ag446cg85ccgfd2c7fc8e1a0" version="1">哭是免费的。想要多少拿多少。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1da3cb4fg63a1g4888g9af6g6533d30912ca" version="1">野性魔法来了。嘴张大点！</content>
	<content contentuid="h834617eag295bg4599g86e8gc850a67d360e" version="1">我见过不少小丑。跟他们比，你就是小丑之王！</content>

	<content contentuid="h826b1598g68a5g4f50g8ef2g48e7f637d249" version="1">这是作弊！这里只有我才可以作弊！</content>
	<content contentuid="h6ef88e95g7a21g4631g9212g188d9b676d5e" version="1">你竟然不知道？！我可是位面之主！！</content>
	<content contentuid="hd37e8063g46a0g4e37gac69g3fa425016b77" version="1">等等。你是不是偷看了我的规则？</content>
	<content contentuid="h3385d7a6g778fg4c2bg8152g0bfcbda067c8" version="1">突发新闻：这小丑居然真能打！</content>

	<content contentuid="hd1edffc2g4d07g4bb2ga361g89413c6d1767" version="1">等等，我还能补救，接上神经，接上——</content>
	<content contentuid="h1580bc60gde67g4570gaa5ag7b63c720688d" version="1">至暗者……给我把水烟点上……</content>
	<content contentuid="hc1861d08g1113g4645ga31eg89fb723392a4" version="1">混沌迟早也会吞了你……废物……啊啊啊……</content>
</contentList>
